[{:db/id "q-345321/field-1/5521c093c4d60c23d630a99bc791ac7318f4615e164361df756510ffc0408a97" :answer/id #uuid "b9fba83f-4290-5b40-b396-bfcc44aeff34" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{14}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-345321/field-1/29e18d29d5a8d00489a807deb821c9d8fb2c816d74392c4ec1d541f26b369225" :answer/id #uuid "2465abe2-d60c-50de-ba70-347ec4490ee4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{16}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-345321/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "df52829b-59f8-5d84-90ef-64a9787ae8a4" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-345321/field-1/5521c093c4d60c23d630a99bc791ac7318f4615e164361df756510ffc0408a97" :answer-field/choices ["q-345321/field-1/5521c093c4d60c23d630a99bc791ac7318f4615e164361df756510ffc0408a97" "q-345321/field-1/29e18d29d5a8d00489a807deb821c9d8fb2c816d74392c4ec1d541f26b369225"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-345321" :question/id #uuid "ee59a109-b2bd-5098-8f6c-967dab2c90fc" :question/math-academy-id "q-345321" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039918/assets/2102626f331aaa7803462f8e427ef2c0150deb554955199f3d402123934e815a.png)\n\nA region is bounded by the curve $y={x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+3$ and the $x$-axis between $x=-1$ and $x=1$, as shown above. Find the area $A$ of the region. Do not round the answer.\n\n$A=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "To find the area, we just need to compute the corresponding definite integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ={\\int }_{a}^{b}y(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}({x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+3)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(\\frac{{x}^{4}}{4}-2\\cdot \\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}+3x){|}_{-1}^{1} \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{2}{3}+3)-(\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{2}{3}-3) \\\\  & =\\frac{31}{12}-(-\\frac{25}{12}) \\\\  & =\\frac{14}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{14}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-345321/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "96967f25-565a-5338-878e-00fd30055772"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-345321"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-11020/selection/e3916a3de5b4729d48e3e38e08e677fa7433370064bb2eb3934514ec75241776" :answer/id #uuid "2d67f8a0-3e1b-5e88-b60d-8f4ed692641e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{91}{20}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11020/selection/c55e2a6a792e6814ed6fa63975035d60fbf5c615ab78effc66c8e958bfb05666" :answer/id #uuid "b3cabd0a-bcd0-5285-9d5d-8e9d38961259" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{41}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11020/selection/0f4c4dd728824ee19d0a7bf37e750d49d803dbb84e7cbc9edb64740edc2f53d0" :answer/id #uuid "a1ed6507-0667-5fe4-8a0b-5a321a99264b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{20}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11020/selection/a6eb76b69796a88b3b8dd42b105e643c8774fc9a36e0b530446de72b7c922213" :answer/id #uuid "853e5b7c-ad0d-51f9-a854-2c5ea1c52749" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{83}{12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11020/selection/212b75daa013d20232c8cad1052558662f3ed2ab731067b368531f831a70b40f" :answer/id #uuid "41c6f5cf-683c-5ae9-8702-81d2222ae093" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{27}{64}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11020/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0ee952cf-3b38-5102-bb1f-b7500cc2ed7a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-11020/selection/c55e2a6a792e6814ed6fa63975035d60fbf5c615ab78effc66c8e958bfb05666" :answer-field/choices ["q-11020/selection/e3916a3de5b4729d48e3e38e08e677fa7433370064bb2eb3934514ec75241776" "q-11020/selection/c55e2a6a792e6814ed6fa63975035d60fbf5c615ab78effc66c8e958bfb05666" "q-11020/selection/0f4c4dd728824ee19d0a7bf37e750d49d803dbb84e7cbc9edb64740edc2f53d0" "q-11020/selection/a6eb76b69796a88b3b8dd42b105e643c8774fc9a36e0b530446de72b7c922213" "q-11020/selection/212b75daa013d20232c8cad1052558662f3ed2ab731067b368531f831a70b40f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-11020" :question/id #uuid "4167f5cf-9f6d-51bc-8664-d6f3f133f408" :question/math-academy-id "q-11020" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039918/assets/36a6f536866d34703f0900304a5859518461fdf0d8c1df42e5269a253c9c3ff2.png)\n\nFind the area between the curve $y=-2{x}^{3}+7{x}^{2}-2$, the $x$-axis and the lines $x=1$ and $x=2$, shown above." :question/worked-solution "To find the area, we just need to compute the corresponding definite integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ={\\int }_{a}^{b}y(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}(-2{x}^{3}+7{x}^{2}-2)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-2{\\int }_{1}^{2}{x}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x+7{\\int }_{1}^{2}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x-2{\\int }_{1}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-2\\cdot {\\frac{{x}^{4}}{4}|}_{1}^{2}+7\\cdot {\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}|}_{1}^{2}-2\\cdot x{|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =-2(\\frac{(2)^{4}}{4}-\\frac{1}{4})+7(\\frac{(2)^{3}}{3}-\\frac{1}{3})-2(2-1) \\\\  & =-\\frac{15}{2}+\\frac{49}{3}-2 \\\\  & =\\frac{41}{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-11020/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "96967f25-565a-5338-878e-00fd30055772"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-11020"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-49178/selection/48e473a11cdfd895b8cf6f1f5745982a2b73b2f85952c74adc3c114eddfe9023" :answer/id #uuid "a5606232-472f-524c-bdd6-6bbc6c44b70e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1+\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\pi +\\operatorname{sin}⁡1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49178/selection/0fb0374822f3342230dedb4dac92d309118c6f9af917bbdafa36d329b3e448a7" :answer/id #uuid "3b1700c8-ebb4-5dbb-b5cb-e125921de9e2" :answer/typ